      "type": "Dictation",
      "info_html": "<h2>Goal</h2><p>Type in the text you hear and press the Check button.</p><p>If the author has set a time limit, you have to type it in before the time runs out.</p><p>The game ends when you press Check on the last screen, or when you run out of time.</p><h2>Controls</h2><p>Simply use the keyboard to type in the text you are hearing, and press the Check button when you have typed in everything you have heard.</p><p>By default you can pause the audio, replay it, and change its playback speed. However, the author of the game can disable these options.</p><h2>Score</h2><p>You get 100 points if you type in the text you have heard correctly, exactly as the author has typed it. If there is more than one screen, each screen counts as 100 divided by the number of screens in the game.</p><p>By default, you lose 5 points on that screen for each misspelled word. However, the author can change the number of points that are not awarded for each error, and can even decide not to penalize errors.</p><p>By default, errors related to capitalization, accents, and punctuation marks are considered, and not those related to line breaks. However, the author can change these options.</p>",
